/*!

@defgroup BRD_SM_MX95AOM5521A1 BOARD_MX95AOM5521A1: i.MX95 AOM-5521-A1 SM Implementation

@brief Module for the i.MX95 AOM-5521-A1 for the SM.

Board Module
============

This port supports the ADVANTECH AOM-5521-A1 i.MX95 board. It is derived from
the i.MX95 EVK port but has no PCAL6408A I2C bus expander. See the
@ref PORT_MX95_AOM5521A1 section for more information.

*/

/** @} */

